  serviceLabel:'Considered in every detail',serviceTitle:'Your story.<br><em>Served beautifully.</em>',serviceText:'A favourite flavour. A shared memory. A drink named just for you. We turn the little things into a cocktail experience with a personal touch.',services:[['Full bar setup','A bar arrangement planned around your setting, service and guest count. We agree equipment, glassware and logistics in your proposal.'],['Professional bartenders','A welcoming team, prepared recipes and an organised service so your guests feel looked after.'],['Signature cocktails','Drinks inspired by your tastes, with classics and alcohol-free choices to make everyone feel included.'],['Personalised cocktail menus','Names, flavours and menu presentation that feel part of your celebration. Personalisation is agreed with you.'],['Guest experience','The welcome, the pace and the final presentation — planned together so the bar complements the day.']],
